1266
00:58:48.300 --> 00:58:54.360
and ancient clowning of two idiots going at it over absurd s**t.

1267
00:58:54.980 --> 00:58:58.600
And in this case, Love and a Prius.

1268
00:58:58.800 --> 00:59:01.000
It was so much fun to shoot.

