1273
00:59:18.340 --> 00:59:19.380
It's so fantastic.

1274
00:59:20.180 --> 00:59:23.540
So I guess Rain was quite comfortable being pinned against the bushes.

1275
00:59:23.540 --> 00:59:24.280
No complaints.

1276
00:59:24.740 --> 00:59:27.320
Well, I can tell you about those big giant hedges.

1277
00:59:27.620 --> 00:59:31.260
One time, Brian in a scene as Kevin nudged me.

1278
00:59:31.460 --> 00:59:32.420
He thought it was a nudge.

1279
00:59:32.540 --> 00:59:33.920
