1282
00:59:43.340 --> 00:59:48.800
very sort of a hedge you could fall into without getting to the other side.

1283
00:59:49.040 --> 00:59:49.240
Aha.

1284
00:59:49.920 --> 00:59:50.080
Aha.

1285
00:59:50.880 --> 00:59:53.140
Well, the hedges might have been a good thing for Rain.

1286
00:59:53.260 --> 00:59:54.920
