1290
01:00:09.880 --> 01:00:11.580
That's what they had allotted for the time.

1291
01:00:11.740 --> 01:00:16.460
And by the time we got to the parking lot scenes on the first day of filming,

1292
01:00:16.700 --> 01:00:21.520
