1293
01:00:21.680 --> 01:00:23.840
If you go and watch, Jenna, you'll see.

1294
01:00:24.020 --> 01:00:24.460
Okay.

1295
01:00:24.460 --> 01:00:25.800
There's a huge shadow.

1296
01:00:26.280 --> 01:00:27.480
Well, now guess what?

1297
01:00:27.480 --> 01:00:32.140
We needed to match that shadow exactly the second day we filmed.

1298
01:00:32.620 --> 01:00:32.980
Yeah.

1299
01:00:33.520 --> 01:00:33.820
Right?

1300
01:00:34.060 --> 01:00:37.840
So in order to do that, they had to create this fake shadow.

1301
01:00:38.040 --> 01:00:39.280
We have fakie shadow.

1302
01:00:39.580 --> 01:00:40.600
Fakie shadow.

1303
01:00:40.900 --> 01:00:41.700
Fakie shadow.

1304
01:00:41.940 --> 01:00:49.360
They used giant 20 by 20 bounce cards and positioned them behind the hedges on the street so that

1305
01:00:49.360 --> 01:00:53.120
